 "derivation_rule": "Pre-registered before any measurement (this manifest is committed before the scenario runs). Plates: the first replicate plate map CP-CC9-R1/R2/R3-01 of source_13, one per batch Run1, Run2, Run3 (the first three batches). Wells: A02 (non-targeting, JCP2022_800002) and A23 (PLK1, JCP2022_805264), the row-A controls of plate-map columns 2 and 23 (JUMP metadata well.csv.gz and crispr.csv.gz). Site: 5 (F005, the centre of the 3 x 3 sites), for every well (amended to sites 4-6, see derivation_amendment). Channels: DNA and RNA. No field, nucleus or object is chosen or removed by its count, size or signal. Before this rule was fixed, site 2 of A02 and A23 on CP-CC9-R1-01 and CP-CC9-R3-01 was viewed to confirm that the images are available and show the reported change; site 5 was not viewed or measured before the rule was committed.",
